* Ampeg SVT preamp, stage 4 of 4: the V4b follower, the mid-range network, V5, the master, and channel 2's stack. V4A's plate (stage 3) arrives
* through VL3 at p4a, where the follower reads it, and V2B's plate (stage 2) through VL2 into C13 and the stack. It has no tube, so it needs no
* supply: the rail source below only exists because every stage has one. See preamp.net for how the netlist is split.

.nodes x p4a k4b f e1 ve e2 vl e3 wm a3 a2 a1t s3 s2 c20 tn g5 k5 out mo p2b a2s bb2 w52 d2 t62 w62 b62

V VRAIL x 1 430
R RDUM x 0 1G

S VL3 p4a 1 0
S VL2 p2b 1 0
C C13 p2b a2s 100n
R R220B a2s bb2 220k
R VR_BS2T bb2 w52 1
R VR_BS2B w52 d2 1
C C001B bb2 w52 1n
C C01B w52 d2 10n
R R22KB d2 0 22k
C C47PB a2s t62 470p
R VR_TR2T t62 w62 1
R VR_TR2B w62 b62 1
C C47NB b62 0 4n7
R R22 w52 w62 120k
R R23 t62 tn 100k

G GB4 k4b p4a 0 2m
R RB4 k4b 0 500
R R37 k4b f 47k
* Mid-range network.
R R36 f e1 6k8
R R38 e1 ve 220k
C C19 f e2 680n
R R39 e2 ve 620
R VR_MIDT ve wm 1
R VR_MIDB wm vl 1
R R34 vl e3 470
C C16 e3 0 680n
.xfmr L1 L=1
  W wm a3 0.292 l1
  W a3 a2 0.222 l1
  W a2 a1t 0.486 l1
  K l1 l1 0.9998
.end
C C17 a3 s3 33n
C C18 a2 s2 150n
R SW_M1 a1t 0 1
R SW_M2 s2 0 1e12
R SW_M3 s3 0 1e12
R R40 a3 0 220k
R R41 a2 0 220k
* Into V5: 0.02u through 100k from the mid-range output, channel 2 through 100k into the same node.
C C20 f c20 100n
R R42 c20 tn 100k
C C21 tn g5 20n
G GB5 k5 g5 0 2.2m
R RB5 k5 0 450
R R43 g5 0 1M
C C22 k5 out 100n
* Master volume (not in the drawing, which has none): a 100k log pot where the drawing has R46's 100k to ground, its wiper feeds the power amp.
R VR_MST out mo 1
R VR_MSB mo 0 1
